   "evidence": "At head, resume is awaited at line 75. Its catch contains only `if (spec.signal.aborted) return cancelled(id);`, `if (workers.agentJob(id)?.state === \"done\") continue;`, and `throw error;`. It never cancels a still-open job. The real engine\u2019s resume hook wraps privacy-list read failures in NeedsHumanError (engine.ts:1135-1145). WorkerStore.heartbeat continues renewing leased jobs, and holdsAgentJob checks lease ownership without checking the run\u2019s status; completeAgentJob accepts the leased result. Base had no reconciliation path and cancelled open jobs during coordinator startup/shutdown. The claim\u2019s separate merge-conflict note concerns process, not this defect."
