   },
   "evidence": "At head, the changed-commit result uses `AbortSignal.timeout(Math.max(0, deadline - Date.now()))` alone (line 861). The retry loop checks and sleeps on that supplied signal (lines 505-526), so aborting the worker-level combined signal does not stop reporting. Shutdown then awaits every job task through `await Promise.allSettled(...)` (lines 983-991). Base passed jobSignal to every result report; that signal included worker shutdown. Head introduced the deadline-only alternative."
  }
